SECTION 2 - LETTER (30 marks)

Your family has just moved to a new town because of your father's job and you have started at a new school. Write a letter IN SPANISH to your friend Marta, who lives in Venezuela, and include ALL of the following:

  (i) when and why your family moved;
  (ii) your new school and two things you like about it;
  (iii) a sport or other activity you have started and how you feel about it;
  (iv) what you would like your friend to do when she comes to visit you.

Write 130-150 words. Do NOT write your real name and address, but include the date in SPANISH and use the appropriate beginning and ending. YOU WILL BE PENALIZED FOR DISREGARDING THESE INSTRUCTIONS.
